*mkdir* | V-$CHIPVR ($CHIPCN)

''mkdir(path, mode)''

Creates a directory with specified permissions.

*Parameters:*
- ''path'': String directory path
- ''mode'': File permissions as a 3 or 4 digit number (e.g. 755, 1777)

*Returns:*
- ''ok'' on success
- ''err'' on failure

*Errors:*
- Runtime error if mode is invalid octal
